{"id":"vod_zy360_74511","vodId":"74511","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"青春猪头少年不会梦到兔女郎学姐","name_cn":"青春猪头少年不会梦到兔女郎学姐","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20250706-1/0cd706852688ec01a6214ebc3a6805c6.jpg"},"summary":"思春期症候群——这是一种只发生在易敏感和不稳定的青春期的、不可思议的现象。例如，在梓川咲太面前出现的野生兔女郎。她的真实身份是高中高年级学生，明星活动休止的女演员樱岛麻衣。她迷人的身姿，不知为何在周围的人眼里看不出来。咲太决定解开这一谜题。在于麻衣一起度过的时间里，咲太知道了她秘密的想法……女主人公们一个接一个地出现于咲太的周围，她们都有着“青春期症候群”。在天空和大海都很闪耀的小镇上，开始了令人激动的故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"爱情,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-07-06 15:38:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/1JVb9cc5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/Y7aSwWiD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/x4mYRr9H/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/PZG5msG9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/xLOumNLE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/9XiFayL9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/N5s2wkcy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/s9dC2FkC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/9FzBMet5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/oFobOTKp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/uGSOwaxY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/1kYtEZd6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250706/Y1hy3ZL9/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T05:52:20.596Z"}